## English summary (for convenience only; the Chinese text controls)

This is a **source-available, non-OSI** license written specifically for Fenestra. Non-commercial use — studying, modifying, self-hosting, education, nonprofits, security research — is free and perpetual. **Any commercial use requires a small, transparent, non-discriminatory paid license from the copyright holder.** Every modified version that is distributed or offered to third parties (including as a service) **must publish its complete corresponding source under these same terms**. Paying for a commercial license does **not** buy the right to close the source or to weaken privacy, security, plugin freedom, speed, or cross-browser extension compatibility. The Chinese text above governs.

